OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CToday:FA damp start across the spine   
OL,6,Fof the UK, with snow across northern   
OL,7,Fhills, turning patchier through the    
OL,8,Fafternoon. Brighter as it clears for   
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland and Scotland though   
OL,10,Fwith blustery showers. Staying dry but 
OL,11,Foften cloudy in the southeast.         
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain turns more        
OL,14,Fpersistent overnight, heaviest across  
OL,15,Fthe southwest. Clear spells across the 
OL,16,Ffar west, Northern Ireland and         
OL,17,FScotland bring a widespread frost.     
OL,18,FStaying dry in the southeast.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
