OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CSaturday:FA wet day for most,          
OL,6,Fpartiularly across southern England    
OL,7,Fand Wales with strong winds developing 
OL,8,Ftowards high ground and the coasts,    
OL,9,Fpotentially gale force at times in the 
OL,10,Fnortheast.                             
